{"id":"n85072-3-8","stage":5,"title":"행세 · 处世","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85072-3-8-1","ko":"넌 왜 그렇게 민준이를 싫어해?","zh":"你为什么那么讨厌敏俊啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넌","audio":"/audio/6a4a5bffadc879e8d8ac.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"“그러하게(那样，那么)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그렇게：“그러하게(那样，那么)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36292","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"민준이를","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"민준이를","audio":"/audio/5f6ad412fa56cdf3c242.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이를","audio":"/audio/5f6ad412fa56cdf3c242.mp3"}},{"text":"싫어해?","meaning":"讨厌，不愿意","explanation":"싫어하다：讨厌，不愿意；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"싫어하다","audio":"/audio/1a00f3250955b45e9391.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64963","senseId":"1","lemma":"싫어하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싫어해","audio":"/audio/8af395c4bebd800cacfd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67