":[{"entryId":"85072","senseId":"3","lemma":"행세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"행세가","audio":"/audio/1db42f3ec70e4846c8f6.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"뻔뻔하잖아.","meaning":"厚颜无耻，脸皮厚","explanation":"뻔뻔하다：厚颜无耻，脸皮厚；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"뻔뻔하다","audio":"/audio/57e86c7d831a0c742ac4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61985","senseId":"1","lemma":"뻔뻔하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뻔뻔하잖아","audio":"/audio/638aacb966e5a1619222.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c11f639d43037d2","term":"자기","zh":"自己","audio":"/audio/1c11f639d43037d2110a.mp3","entryId":"57310","definition":"重指前面已经讲过的人。","pronunciation":["자기"]},{"id":"cd1c34de004dbb0d","term":"잘못","zh":"错，错误","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3","entryId":"62477","definition":"做不好或做错的事。","pronunciation":["잘몯"]},{"id":"e43a28aa552de482","term":"남","zh":"别人，他人，人家","audio":"/audio/e43a28aa552de4826029.mp3","entryId":"28394","definition":"除我之外的其他人。","pronunciation":["남"]},{"id":"c56b12cde62f415a","term":"미루다","zh":"推脱，推诿","audio":"/audio/c56b12cde62f415abd7b.mp3","entryId":"15760","definition":"将事情或责任等推给别人。","pronunciation":["미루다"]},{"id":"ac8c98c782e9f38e","term":"행세","zh":"处世","audio":"/audio/ac8c98c782e9f38ebbf1.mp3","entryId":"85072","definition":"在人际关系中与人融洽相处；或指这种态度。","pronunciation":["행세"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"57e86c7d831a0c74","term":"뻔뻔하다","zh":"厚颜无耻，脸皮厚","audio":"/audio/57e86c7d831a0c742ac4.mp3","entryId":"61985","definition":"做了羞耻的事，态度却泰然自若且理直气壮。","pronunciation":["뻔뻔하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/58f9dddc3f03c3a9c0b0.m